## Technology Stack (frontend-v3 only)
| Purpose | Required | Forbidden |
|---|---|---|
| Core UI components | PatternFly 6 via `Ha*` wrappers | Tailwind, Radix, MUI, Ant Design, shadcn |
| Dense grids | AG Grid Community 36 via `SiemDataGrid` | PF Table for large datasets |
| Charts | Apache ECharts via `HaChart` | Chart.js, Recharts, D3 directly |
| Dashboard layout | GridStack.js 13 via `DashboardCanvas` | CSS grid for drag-drop |
| Server state | TanStack Query v5 | SWR, RTK Query |
| UI state | Zustand v5 | Redux, MobX, Context for global state |
| Routing | React Router v6 | Next.js router, TanStack Router |
| Query editors | Monaco Editor | CodeMirror, Ace |

## Row Density Standards
- Compact: 32px — high-volume alert grids (default)
- Standard: 40px
- Comfortable: 48px
- Persisted to `localStorage` key `ha_row_density`

## Shared Components (already built — import, do not re-implement)
- `@/pages/alerts/alertColumns.tsx` — shared AG Grid column defs for alerts
- `@/components/status-dock/StatusDock.tsx` — 28px fixed bottom bar (SSE state + EPS)
- `@/components/filter-chips/FilterChipsRow.tsx` — dismissible filter chip row
- `@/components/live-mode-toggle/LiveModeToggle.tsx` — Live/Historical pill toggle
- `@/hooks/useAlertStream.ts` — SSE alert stream
- `@/hooks/useEpsStream.ts` — SSE EPS counter
- `@/store/alertStream.store.ts` — Zustand store: `newAlertCount`, `clearNewAlertCount`, `latestEvent`
- `@/lib/severity.ts` — severity helpers (import from here, never duplicate)
- `@/lib/status.ts` — status helpers (import from here, never duplicate)

## Validation Gates — Run After Every Session
```bash
cd frontend-v3
npm run lint        # zero ESLint errors
npm run type-check  # zero TypeScript errors (tsc --noEmit)
npm run test        # all Vitest tests pass
npm run build       # production build succeeds
```
Do not mark a session complete if any gate fails.

## Anti-Patterns (Forbidden UI)
- Glassmorphism (`backdrop-filter: blur`)
- Neon glow effects
- Decorative gradients on data surfaces
- Border-radius > 8px on primary data surfaces
- Nested cards inside cards
- Multiple permanent toolbars stacked vertically
- Animated world maps

## Security — Known Open Issues (do not replicate)
| ID | Gap | What to avoid in new code |
|---|---|---|
| SEC-03 | CLOSED (STAGING CANDIDATE) — `PUT /api/offenses/{id}/status` + `POST /api/ha-correlated-findings/{id}/status` have `@PreAuthorize(ALERT_QUEUE_AUTH)` and allowlisted scripts | Keep `GAP_SEC_03_RESOLVED = true`; UI gates via `canMutateFindingStatus` (ROLE_ADMIN\|SOC_MANAGER\|ANALYST\|SOC_ANALYST) |
| SEC-05 | Agent-manager gRPC is INTERNAL_KEY-only (by design) | REST mutates are ROLE_ADMIN\|SOC_MANAGER; SensorGrid isolate/kill stay disabled until `REMOTE_SENSOR_ACTIONS_LIVE_VERIFIED` flips after ProcessCommand→agent proof |
| SEC-06 | CLOSED (STAGING CANDIDATE) — `POST /api/ha-visualizations/run` has `@PreAuthorize` | Keep `GAP_SEC_06_RESOLVED = true`; UI still gates via `canRunVisualization` (ROLE_ADMIN\|SOC_MANAGER\|ANALYST) |

## Role Labels — Use Human Names, Not ROLE_ Constants
Never expose internal role constants as UI copy. Map through a label function:
| Internal constant | User-facing label |
|---|---|
| ROLE_ADMIN | Platform Administrator |
| ROLE_SOC_MANAGER | SOC Manager |
| ROLE_ANALYST | Analyst |
| ROLE_THREAT_HUNTER | Threat Hunter |
| ROLE_READ_ONLY | Read Only |
| ROLE_USER | Standard User |

Access-denied messages must say "Required permission: Platform Administrator" not "You need ROLE_ADMIN".

