## rgba() / Color-Mix Rule
When you need a semi-transparent version of a token color for badge backgrounds, use `color-mix()`:
```css
/* ✅ correct */
background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ha-critical) 15%, transparent);
/* ❌ wrong */
background: rgba(255, 93, 108, 0.15);
```

## Mock Data Rule (Dev Only)
When a backend endpoint exists but returns no data in local dev, seed data through the API via
`local-dev/seed-dev-data.sh` — do NOT hardcode mock data into UI components.
Storybook fixtures (`.stories.tsx`) are the only place static mock data is permitted.

## File Path Conventions
- New pages: `frontend-v3/src/pages/<feature>/`
- New shared components: `frontend-v3/src/components/<name>/`
- New hooks: `frontend-v3/src/hooks/`
- New services: `frontend-v3/src/services/`  (NEVER create service files inside pages/)
- New types: add to `frontend-v3/src/types/api.types.ts`
- New lib helpers: `frontend-v3/src/lib/`
- Do NOT create service files inside `src/pages/` — always use `src/services/`
